{
  "id": "16-letters",
  "title": "Letters and modifiers",
  "goal": "Spell a name or acronym letter by letter; chord Ctrl, Alt and other modifiers for shortcuts.",
  "blocks": [
    { "t": "h", "x": "Fingerspelling in running text" },
    { "t": "p", "x": "Each letter is a chord plus the star, which glues it to adjacent letters. Add `-P` for a capital. Hold `*` and tap letter chords: each tap is one letter, and lifting `*` first sends nothing." },
    { "t": "table", "head": ["Letter", "Stroke", "Letter", "Stroke", "Letter", "Stroke"], "rows": [
      ["a", "[[A*]]", "j", "[[SKWR*]]", "s", "[[S*]]"],
      ["b", "[[PW*]]", "k", "[[K*]]", "t", "[[T*]]"],
      ["c", "[[KR*]]", "l", "[[HR*]]", "u", "[[*U]]"],
      ["d", "[[TK*]]", "m", "[[PH*]]", "v", "[[SR*]]"],
      ["e", "[[*E]]", "n", "[[TPH*]]", "w", "[[W*]]"],
      ["f", "[[TP*]]", "o", "[[O*]]", "x", "[[KP*]]"],
      ["g", "[[TKPW*]]", "p", "[[P*]]", "y", "[[KWR*]]"],
      ["h", "[[H*]]", "q", "[[KW*]]", "z", "[[STKPW*]]"],
      ["i", "[[*EU]]", "r", "[[R*]]", "capital A", "[[A*P]]"]
    ] },
    { "t": "p", "x": "Letter chords are the starting-sound chords: `PW` is *b*, `TK` is *d*, `STKPW` is *z*. Letters glue only to each other, so `KR*P` `A*` `T*` types *Cat*." },
    { "t": "explore", "x": "Strike a letter with the star to see it." },
    { "t": "h", "x": "Modifiers: Ctrl, Alt, Super, Shift" },
    { "t": "p", "x": "A shortcut is a letter chord, right-hand modifier keys, then the ender `LGTS`, which stops a word firing it by accident." },
    { "t": "table", "head": ["Right-hand key", "Modifier"], "rows": [["`R`", "Shift"], ["`B`", "Alt"], ["`P`", "Super"], ["`F`", "Ctrl"]] },
    { "t": "table", "head": ["Shortcut", "Stroke"], "rows": [
      ["Ctrl+S", "[[S-FLGTS]]"],
      ["Ctrl+C", "[[KR-FLGTS]]"],
      ["Alt+D", "[[TK-BLGTS]]"],
      ["Super+V", "[[SR-PLGTS]]"],
      ["Shift+B", "[[PW-RLGTS]]"]
    ] },
    { "t": "p", "x": "Modifiers combine: `KPWR*EFPBLGTS` is Ctrl+Super+Alt+Up. Digits: `AO` plus the bottom-row left keys as binary, `R`=1, `W`=2, `K`=4, `S`=8, added together." },
    { "t": "h", "x": "Spelling mode" },
    { "t": "p", "x": "A few words have no pronunciation on record, so no sound to derive them from. Spelling mode covers them: a run starts with the `~` marker instead of `+`, then **every stroke is one letter chord** (`A` is *a*, `PW` is *b*, ...). Every stroke after the first still carries the join key." },
    { "t": "note", "kind": "warn", "x": "`~` has no physical key in the live config yet: it is a rule the generator and fallback know, not typable." }
  ],
  "drill": {
    "title": "Fingerspelling",
    "check": "dict",
    "pass": 90,
    "repeat": 2,
    "items": [
      { "p": "a", "o": ["A*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&a}" }, { "p": "b", "o": ["PW*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&b}" }, { "p": "c", "o": ["KR*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&c}" },
      { "p": "d", "o": ["TK*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&d}" }, { "p": "e", "o": ["*E"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&e}" }, { "p": "f", "o": ["TP*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&f}" },
      { "p": "g", "o": ["TKPW*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&g}" }, { "p": "h", "o": ["H*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&h}" }, { "p": "i", "o": ["*EU"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&i}" },
      { "p": "j", "o": ["SKWR*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&j}" }, { "p": "k", "o": ["K*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&k}" }, { "p": "l", "o": ["HR*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&l}" },
      { "p": "m", "o": ["PH*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&m}" }, { "p": "n", "o": ["TPH*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&n}" }, { "p": "o", "o": ["O*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&o}" },
      { "p": "p", "o": ["P*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&p}" }, { "p": "q", "o": ["KW*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&q}" }, { "p": "r", "o": ["R*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&r}" },
      { "p": "s", "o": ["S*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&s}" }, { "p": "t", "o": ["T*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&t}" }, { "p": "u", "o": ["*U"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&u}" },
      { "p": "v", "o": ["SR*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&v}" }, { "p": "w", "o": ["W*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&w}" }, { "p": "x", "o": ["KP*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&x}" },
      { "p": "y", "o": ["KWR*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&y}" }, { "p": "z", "o": ["STKPW*"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{>}{&z}" },
      { "p": "capital A", "o": ["A*P"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{&A}" }, { "p": "capital B", "o": ["PW*P"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{&B}" }, { "p": "capital C", "o": ["KR*P"], "w": "{:firstup:except=*}{&C}" },
      { "p": "Ctrl+S", "o": ["S-FLGTS"], "w": "{:firstup:except=-FRPBLGTS}{^}{#control(s)}{^}" }, { "p": "Ctrl+C", "o": ["KR-FLGTS"], "w": "{:firstup:except=-FRPBLGTS}{^}{#control(c)}{^}" },
      { "p": "Alt+D", "o": ["TK-BLGTS"], "w": "{:firstup:except=-FRPBLGTS}{^}{#alt(d)}{^}" }
    ]
  }
}
